{"3851960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Walk Along The Shore", "steam_appid": 3851960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunsets, greet the dawns to the sound of ocean waves and... don't miss anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk along the shore, collect garbage and find real treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.poster.avif?t=1760973240\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.webm?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.mp4?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of strange garbage will tell the story of this island, and cleaning the beach will help unlock new locations. With each step, you get closer to a clean coast... and to the main secret of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.poster.avif?t=1760973240\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.webm?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.mp4?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a metal detector to find garbage in the sand, dig up the sand with a shovel and take the found items for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling garbage unlocks new locations and helps earn money to upgrade tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded tools will help you find treasures in the sand more easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUACK-QUACK-QUACK!!!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunsets, greet the dawns to the sound of ocean waves and... don't miss anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk along the shore, collect garbage and find real treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.poster.avif?t=1760973240\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.webm?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/c302dd8891a1848a3bc37ceb779a059d.mp4?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountains of strange garbage will tell the story of this island, and cleaning the beach will help unlock new locations. With each step, you get closer to a clean coast... and to the main secret of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.poster.avif?t=1760973240\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.webm?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/extras/fbe56b61ce8c2f93782350fbdee38e31.mp4?t=1760973240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a metal detector to find garbage in the sand, dig up the sand with a shovel and take the found items for recycling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recycling garbage unlocks new locations and helps earn money to upgrade tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded tools will help you find treasures in the sand more easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QUACK-QUACK-QUACK!!!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A garbage collection and treasure hunting simulator on a secret island! Earn money by finding items and upgrade your tools. Collect garbage and unlock new locations. Find clues and uncover the corporation's secret.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/b74fb0fef00137b4ccec5ca3c9cf6f5e63f79a7e/header.jpg?t=1760973240", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/38a19b600643e028befd1c6cd96cf2a7808869b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760973240", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851960/38a19b600643e028befd1c6cd96cf2a7808869b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760973240", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz or Ryzen 3xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Izotope Games"], "publishers": ["Ro